+// realityClientVersion is the REALITY protocol client version marker written
+// into the encrypted session_id (Version_x/y/z) and reported to the server.
+// It MUST track the current Xray core release: panel servers reject clients
+// whose version bytes are older than their configured minimum, which makes
+// every REALITY handshake fall back to the camouflage site ("REALITY:
+// processed invalid connection"). hotfix-14: the value was frozen at 25.5.16
+// (the May 2025 Xray release) and got rejected by up-to-date panels;
+// 26.10.31 matches the current Xray release.
+var realityClientVersion = [3]byte{26, 10, 31}
